{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Neon Village is a deck-builder game that combines &quot;match-3 puzzle&quot; and &quot;roguelike&quot; elements. Gather unique residents and create your own neon village!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916670/extras/ca9424a0d0c5b3b25afed7759be8b905.poster.avif?t=1755051607\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916670/extras/ca9424a0d0c5b3b25afed7759be8b905.webm?t=1755051607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916670/extras/ca9424a0d0c5b3b25afed7759be8b905.mp4?t=1755051607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Deck Builder</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect hardworking residents, wild animals, helpful machines, and enticing pieces. Combining pieces correctly can trigger explosive synergies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916670/extras/967d6d5d1c7f46d9d2caf7d4c83efb0c.poster.avif?t=1755051607\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916670/extras/967d6d5d1c7f46d9d2caf7d4c83efb0c.webm?t=1755051607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916670/extras/967d6d5d1c7f46d9d2caf7d4c83efb0c.mp4?t=1755051607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Items to Aid Village Development</u></strong></p><p class=\"